| Defect ID | Location             | Defect                                                        | Expected Behaviour                                                                                       | Actual Behaviour                               | Correction                                                                     | Status           |
| --------- | -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------- |
| D001      | Subtotal calculation | `price + quantity` was used instead of multiplication         | Subtotal should be `price * quantity`                                                                    | Price and quantity were added together         | Changed `+` to `*`                                                             | Fixed            |
| D002      | Shipping condition   | `>` was used instead of `<`                                   | Shipping of £5 should apply when amount after discount is **below £50**                                  | Shipping was applied when amount was above £50 | Changed `>` to `<`                                                             | Fixed            |
| D003      | Quantity validation  | Incorrect condition was used for checking quantity            | Quantity must be greater than 0                                                                          | Invalid quantities could be accepted           | Changed condition to `quantity <= 0`                                           | Fixed            |
| D004      | Price validation     | Price validation used `price <= 0`                            | Price must not be negative, so `0` should technically be allowed                                         | A price of `0` is rejected                     | Change to `price < 0` if zero is allowed                                       | **Needs review** |
| D005      | Error handling       | `except Exception` catches every exception and only prints it | Errors should be handled appropriately and the function should still have a predictable return behaviour | Function returns `None` after an exception     | Consider handling `ValueError` specifically or allowing the error to propagate | **Needs review** |
